# Heavy, regenerable outputs. Everything here is reproduced by run_all.sh from
# the upstream pipeline's output plus the scripts in R/ and analyses/.
#
# No trailing slashes on these: if a path is ever a WSL symlink, a trailing
# slash makes `git add` fail outright with "Function not implemented".
/results
/data
/work

# R session state — never committed. Day-to-day these are hundreds of MB.
*.RData
*.rda
*.rds
*.Rds
*.RDS
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
.RData
.Ruserdata
.Rproj.user/
*.Rproj

# WGCNA writes topological overlap matrices next to the working directory.
*-block.*.RData
*.TOM
TOM-block.*

# Alignment and variant files, in case anything is ever copied in by hand.
*.bam
*.bai
*.sam
*.cram
*.fastq
*.fastq.gz
*.fq.gz
*.vcf
*.vcf.gz
*.vcf.gz.tbi
*.fa
*.fasta
*.gtf
*.gff
*.gff3

# WebGestaltR writes a directory of HTML reports per database. The small
# summaries we keep are copied into showcase/ by summarize_results.R.
/WG
Project_*/

# Logs are committed on purpose — they are the record of how each number was
# reached — but not the noisy per-worker ones.
logs/*.tmp
logs/*.part

# Editors and OS litter
.Rprofile.local
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*~
*.swp
__pycache__/
